From 19f6c6928f3c1b4d40f5086720b9e6078b7b4e68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PJ Onori <pj.onori@sanity.io>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 19:27:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: add DSDS 0.20.0 support (entries, id, sections,
 YAML)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Bump bundled schema to 0.20.0 (entries-based, schemaVersion root field)
- Add yaml dependency for .dsds.yaml file support
- Loader: detect 0.20.0 format, normalize entries (id→identifier,
  sections→documentBlocks/agentDocumentBlocks) for backward compat,
  resolve refs/entries arrays, parse YAML files via file extension
- Validator: validate against 0.20.0 schema only; return migration hint
  for legacy dsdsVersion documents; accept JSON or YAML string input
- config: default schemaVersion to BUNDLED_VERSION instead of hardcoded 0.15.2
- knowledge: add system/entry kinds, SECTION_KIND_DESCRIPTIONS,
  update scaffolds to 0.20.0 format for the 5 new canonical kinds
- get-entity: show sections[] (0.20.0) when present, fall back to
  legacy documentBlocks
- author-component-doc: assemble 0.20.0 documents (schemaVersion,
  entries[], sections with for:human, guidelines use statement not guidance)
- Tests: update fixtures and assertions for 0.20.0 format
