From f01a58696a5a98ed7492799b87e2da582e2f2910 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PJ Onori <pj.onori@sanity.io>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 22:12:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(mcp): update tools for DSDS 0.20.0 sections format

- spec-overview: replace dsdsVersion/entity/entityGroups with schemaVersion/entries[]
- spec-document-blocks: reorient to 0.20.0 section kinds (guidelines, definitions, steps, section) with legacy block list preserved for pre-0.20.0 kinds
- spec-entity-schema: distinguish 0.20.0 kinds (id + sections) from legacy (identifier + documentBlocks); show valid section kinds for 0.20.0 entries
- spec-scaffold: update instructional text for 0.20.0 vs legacy scaffolds
- get-document-block: match sections by title as well as kind for 0.20.0 generic sections
- get-agent-context: update description and empty-state message for 0.20.0 sections with for:"agent"; fix renderGuidelines to use statement ?? guidance
- to-markdown: fix renderGuidelines/renderAccessibility to use statement ?? guidance; add rendering for 0.20.0 section/definitions/steps kinds
- build-component: find variants/api blocks by title fallback for 0.20.0; read id ?? identifier from variant and prop items
- knowledge.js: fix SECTION_KIND_DESCRIPTIONS.guidelines to say `statement` not `guidance`
